# Video masters. Any `video/raw/` folder holds camera originals; the re-encodes
# beside it are what ships. Masters stay out of git because history is
# permanent — committing them and re-encoding later leaves both copies in the
# pack forever, and this repo is already ~350 MB. They are therefore NOT backed
# up by git: keep a copy somewhere else.
**/video/raw/

# Documents staged for upload to the S3 store. Any `_upload/` folder holds
# manuals, archives and firmware that belong in the S3 store, never in git —
# see docs/design/file-hosting.md. They are gitignored on purpose: CI has no
# local copy, so a page committed before its document was uploaded fails the
# build instead of shipping a dead link. The underscore also keeps Docusaurus
# from treating the directory as routable content.
**/_upload/

.vscode/
# Claude Code config/instructions — not site content
.claude/*
CLAUDE.md
# Exception: this skill is a shared team convention, not local config
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/vendor-interface-summary/
!.claude/skills/vendor-interface-summary/**

# Python bytecode from the publish/check scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Packaged CloudFormation output
infra/*.packaged.yaml
